# inc-4999 phase 3: Priest swap with no book. Read by tools/check_rest_per_source.sh
# case b. Load tools/fixtures/chars/orc-priest-seed4-gate.sav (not in wizard
# mode, so `w y` is needed). Descend to depth 2, genocide everything, open Learn
# Spells (the table sorts by source then name; this character holds only divine
# spells, so the rows are in name order -- this character holds 6 of 4 level-1
# slots), unmark Bane, Bless and Call Companions (the level must drop below 4
# before a mark is accepted), mark Detect Evil (row 7), confirm (ENTER opens the
# summary box, a second ENTER confirms), rest.
s                       # one real turn: this counts as a session (exit 5 otherwise)
w y
@choose "Ascend / Descend Depth"
"2" ENTER
# The wizard descent keeps x,y, so a chasm square there makes the player fall (inc-mj17);
# each fall waits for ENTER. Any number of falls is fine.
@while "You fall" ENTER
@until "HP:" ESC
# The first w can be swallowed by the pending "Done." message (inc-mj17): press it until the menu shows.
@until "Genocide Everything" w
@choose "Genocide Everything"
@until "HP:" ESC

d
L
SPACE
DOWN
SPACE
DOWN
SPACE
DOWN*4
SPACE
@dump:swapped
ENTER
ENTER
@until "Things in View" ESC
@dump:before-rest
z
y
@dump:after-rest
# A disguised monster's reveal can put a -- more -- in the rest message; the rest finishes (and
# the probe logs) only after it is answered (inc-mj17).
@while "-- more --" SPACE
@dump:end
